rows.en:
"Hundred-Day Trends Concerning Human Life and Death!"
I shouted the report's title at Fukuzawa as she lunged at me.
Suddenly, Fukuzawa froze.{p}

I hurriedly reached up to the ledge of the stall and grabbed the ampoule.
Slowly, so I wouldn't drop it, and so I wouldn't crush it in my grip.
I took the cap off the ampoule and drank it down in one gulp.{p}

...Phew. It looked like I'd made it in time.
Did this mean I was saved?
I'd wait here until the time came.{p}

"...Let's go home. ...I'm going home."
I muttered it over and over to keep my spirits up.
The school gate was right in front of me.{p}

"Ahaha... You can barely even walk.
Me, on the other hand, I'm in perfect shape. There's no need for a contest at all.
Now, die for me. And become the killer who murdered six losers and one teacher."{p}
